<title>UNITED NATIONS: U.N. chief &quot;delighted&quot; Yeltsin operation went well.</title>
<headline>U.N. chief &quot;delighted&quot; Yeltsin operation went well.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secretary-General Boutros Boutros-Ghali sent a note to Russian President Boris Yeltsin Tuesday saying he was &quot;delighted to learn the wonderful news that your surgery has been successful.&quot;</p>
<p>He congratulated Yeltsin and said he hoped he had a swift convalescence from his heart operation.</p>
<p>Boutros-Ghali last saw the Russian leader during a visit to Moscow in May.</p>
</text>
